@startuml
title Dynamic revision round
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "review-response child" as Revise
participant "reviewer child" as ReReview
database "Run files + handoffs" as Files
Agent -> CLI : instructions node:.../revision@round
CLI --> Agent : eligible under frozen graph authorization
Agent -> CLI : start revision child
Agent -> Revise : produce revised manuscript and response
Revise -> Files : external outputs + handoff
Agent -> CLI : start re-review child
Agent -> ReReview : verify revised manuscript
ReReview -> Files : review synthesis + handoff
Agent -> User : accept or continue?
User --> Agent : confirmed branch choice
Agent -> CLI : decide decision:.../revision-outcome@round
CLI -> Files : record Decision and derive next frontier
@enduml

